The '''Mystic Marsh''' is a location in the {{Zone|Crimson Isle}} that is near the {{Zone|Mage Outpost}}. {{MobSprite|Mushroom Bull}}s and {{Item|Exe}}s (as well as {{Item|Wai}}s and {{Item|Zee}}s) can be found here. {{Item|Mycelium}} can be mined here. {{Item|Moldfin}} Trophy Fish can be reeled here.

